# rudderstack_account_source_snowflake (Resource)

This resource represents a Snowflake rETL account for storing warehouse credentials used in reverse-ETL pipelines. Snowflake supports two authentication methods, selected via `authentication_type`: `keyPair` (supply `private_key`, optionally `private_key_passphrase`) or `password` (supply `password`). For more information check
https://www.rudderstack.com/docs/sources/reverse-etl/snowflake/

